{"ID":"20240619192512-sq7e8k5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240619192512-sq7e8k5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619192512-sq7e8k5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619192517-mki8pb4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620080336-61pn839\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1103,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620080336-61pn839\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"五色梅(马缨丹)","type":"doc","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240620080336-61pn839","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620080336-61pn839","updated":"20240709130508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 452px;","style":"width: 442px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 8-20240709130508-ho7acza.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 442px;\" parent-style=\"width: 452px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125600-pux6rit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125600-pux6rit","updated":"20240709125819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 791px;","style":"width: 781px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 2-20240709125813-u657ltf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 781px;\" parent-style=\"width: 791px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅-20240709125600-8ebt9rf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125817-ueubklp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125817-ueubklp","updated":"20240709125836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 1-20240709125739-4hxreyu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 755px;","style":"width: 745px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 3-20240709125836-crvvlon.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 745px;\" parent-style=\"width: 755px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125908-s4mifx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125908-s4mifx4","updated":"20240709130054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 481px;","style":"width: 471px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 4-20240709125908-9dcyd9m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 471px;\" parent-style=\"width: 481px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 714px;","style":"width: 704px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 5-20240709130054-o2c7oly.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 704px;\" parent-style=\"width: 714px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709130130-zwjbs5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709130130-zwjbs5r","updated":"20240709130329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 591px;","style":"width: 581px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 6-20240709130130-ktv6axz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 581px;\" parent-style=\"width: 591px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五色梅 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五色梅 7-20240709130329-q3wl668.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709130335-b1x1llr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240709130335-b1x1llr"}},{"ID":"20240830115119-u28xki2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-u28xki2","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：五色梅"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-9mt2mdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-9mt2mdz","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五色梅《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-xiv0yzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-xiv0yzm","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔSèMéi"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-4chlli0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-4chlli0","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】马缨丹、红彩花、头晕花、如意花"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-hsmpno0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-hsmpno0","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为马鞭草科马樱丹属植物五色梅LantanacamaraL.，以根或全株入药。全年可采，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-noj79ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-noj79ed","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】直立或半藤状灌木，高可达2米，有强烈臭气，全株被短毛。茎枝常有下弯钩刺。叶对生，卵形或长圆状卵形。四季开花，花序腋生，花冠高脚碟状，4～5裂，有红、粉红、黄、橙黄、白等多种颜色，故名“五色梅”。核果球形，肉质，成熟时紫黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-5ef8i9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-5ef8i9l","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】根：淡，凉。枝、叶：苦，凉，具臭气。有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-uvmm6mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-uvmm6mb","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】根：清热解毒，散结止痛。用于感冒高烧，久热不退，颈淋巴结核，风湿骨痛，胃痛，跌打损伤。叶、枝：外用治湿疹，皮炎，皮肤瘙痒，疖肿，跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-rr9wzdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-rr9wzdh","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】根：1～2两；枝叶外用适量，煎水洗或用鲜叶捣烂外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-bxx3fx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-bxx3fx7","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-p6f61t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-p6f61t2","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五色梅《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-5hg9q73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-5hg9q73","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《广西中药志》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-kg6nhn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-kg6nhn0","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔSèMéi"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-o5udb8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-o5udb8j","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】山大丹、大红绣球、珊瑚球（《南越笔记》），龙船花（《植物名实图考》），臭金凤、如意花、昏花（《岭南采药录》），七变花（《华北经济植物志要》），如意草（《广州植物志》），土红花、臭牡丹、杀虫花（《南宁市药物志》），毛神花（《闽南民间草药》），臭冷风（《广西中药志》），天兰草（《湖南药物志》），臭草（广州部队《常用中草药手册》），五色花、五雷箭、穿墙风（《广西中草药》），野眼菜（江西《草药手册》），五彩花、红花刺、婆姐花（《福建中草药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-0d5iw1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-0d5iw1s","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为马鞭草科植物马缨丹的叶或带花叶的嫩枝。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-dkdbyi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-dkdbyi9","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-yqwbb37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-yqwbb37","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"马缨丹（《南越笔记》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ik83a8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ik83a8r","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直立或半藤状灌木，有强烈气味，稍被毛，高1～2米，若为藤状时，高常倍之；茎枝无刺或有下弯钩刺。叶对生；卵形或矩圆状卵形，长3～9厘米，先端短渐尖，基部阔楔形，边缘有钝齿，上面祖糙而有短刺毛，下面被小刚毛。头状花序稠密，连花冠宽2-3.5厘米；花序柄腋生，粗壮，常较叶为长；苞片狭长，约为花冠的1／3～1/2；花冠粉红色、红色、黄色或橙红色，长约1厘米。花冠简细长，裂片4～5；雄蕊4，不外露；子房2室。核果球形，肉质，长约5毫米，成熟时紫黑色，有骨质的小分核2颗。花期：全年开花。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-9wvngrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-9wvngrl","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根（五色梅根）、花（五色梅花）亦供药用：各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ir1wvc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ir1wvc6","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】野生于村落旁或裁培于庭园。分布广东、广西、福建、江西、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-va87tvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-va87tvi","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-c9v7iba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-c9v7iba","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ps3qusv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ps3qusv","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《南宁市药物志》：\"苦，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-cxi6bnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-cxi6bnz","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《广西中药志》：\"味苦，性寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-0h0elsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-0h0elsd","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③广州部队《常用中草药手册》：\"辛凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-yg8m85y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-yg8m85y","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《广西中草药》：\"味微甘辛，性凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-tzg82we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-tzg82we","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-90a3vsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-90a3vsh","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"消肿解毒，祛风止痒。治痈肿，湿毒，疥癞，毒疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ed4tj2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ed4tj2p","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《岭南采药录》：\"洗湿毒疥癞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-m3j3dm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-m3j3dm0","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《南宁市药物志》：\"叶：治疥癜毒疮，跌打止血。花：可止血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ern07wo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ern07wo","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《广东中药》：\"祛风止痒，消肿止痛，散毒，敷大肠疡痈。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-5zn2lol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-5zn2lol","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《广西中草药》：\"全草：退热，杀虫止痒，消疮疡。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-8k6zafu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-8k6zafu","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，0.5～1两；或捣汁冲酒。外用：捣敷或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-osqm29v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-osqm29v","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】《福建中草药》：\"孕妇忌服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-yz90h6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-yz90h6o","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-8ydllar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-8ydllar","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治毒核症：臭金风叶捣烂，取自然汁，用双蒸酒冲服。又将叶捣烂，加红糖、冰片少许，敷于核上，不时转换，即可清凉止痛。（《岭南采药录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-5v3zoew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-5v3zoew","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治筋伤：毛神花鲜叶捣碎，擦患处，然后以渣敷之。（《闽南民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-mewibq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-mewibq8","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治皮炎、湿疹瘙痒：马缨丹新鲜枝叶煎水外洗.（广州部队《常用中草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-w6cwt7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-w6cwt7y","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治跌打扭伤；马缨丹鲜叶捣烂外敷。（广州部队《常用中草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-0kst09j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-0kst09j","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治感冒风热：五色花叶一两，山芝麻五钱。水煎，日分二次服。（《广西中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-sgigy76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-sgigy76","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-9zyg769","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-9zyg769","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五色梅《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-2i1jf32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-2i1jf32","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《广西中药志》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-h13yy79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-h13yy79","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔSèMéi"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-42kk3p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-42kk3p8","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CommonLantanaLeaf，LeafofCommonLantana"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-9cmdy96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-9cmdy96","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】龙船花、山大丹、大红乡球、珊瑚球、臭金凤、如意花、土红花、杀虫花、臭牡丹、毛神花、臭冷风、天兰草、臭草、五色花、五雷箭、穿墙风、野眼菜、五彩花、红花刺"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-7mgbqtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-7mgbqtx","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-1kojwy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-1kojwy1","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为马鞭草科植物马缨丹的花。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-il35rjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-il35rjd","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：LantanacamaraL."}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ses3hmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ses3hmv","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-w4ijd24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-w4ijd24","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】马缨丹，直立或蔓性灌木。植株有臭味，高1-2m，有时呈藤状，长可达4m。茎、枝均呈四方形，有糙毛，常有下弯的钩刺或无刺。单叶对生；叶柄长约1cm；叶片卵形至卵状长圆形，长3-9cm，宽1.5-5cm，基部楔形或心形，边缘有钝齿，先端渐尖或急尖，表面有粗糙的皱纹和短柔毛，背面具小刚毛，侧脉约5对。头状花序腋生，花序直径1.5-2.5cm；花序醒粗壮，长于顺柄；苞片披针莆，长为花萼的1-3倍，有短柔毛；花萼筒状，先端有极短的齿；花冠黄色、橙色、粉红色至深红色，花冠管长约1cm，两面均有细短毛，直径4-6cm；雄蕊4，内藏果实圆球形，成熟时紫黑色。全年开花。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-w5az8nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-w5az8nc","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-nasyx5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-nasyx5s","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：常生于海拔80-1500m的海边沙滩、路边及空旷地。我国庭园有栽培。福建、台湾、广东、广西有逸生。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-p064fze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-p064fze","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：原产美洲热带地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-w7nd5m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-w7nd5m4","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】带花的全草含脂类，其脂肪酸组成有肉豆蔻酸（myristicacid），棕榈酸（palmiticacid），花生酸（arachidicacid），油酸（oleicacid），亚油酸（linoleicacid）等，其非皂化部分有α香树脂醇（α-amyrin）,β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol）及1-三十烷醇（1-triacontanol），还含葡萄糖（glucose），麦芽糖（maltose），鼠李糖（rhamnose）。花叶挥发油含α-水芹烯（α-phellandrene），二戊烯（dipentene），α-松油醇（α-terpineol），牻牛儿醇（geraniol），芳樟醇（linalool），桉叶素（cineole），丁午油酚（evgenol），柠檬烯（citral），糠醛（furfural），水芹酮（phellandrone），葛缕酮（carvone），β-丁午烯（β-caryophyllene），对-聚伞花素（ρ-cymene），α-、β、蒎烯（pinene），1，4-樟烯（1，4-camphene），月桂烯（myrcene），香桧烯（sabinene）及α-玷(王巴)烯（α-copaene）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-nl0ycna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-nl0ycna","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】五然梅有抑制脂质过氧化物形成的作用，抑制豚鼠不同组织的脂质过氧化作用的顺序是：肾上腺\u003e肝\u003e肾\u003e心\u003e肺\u003e脑。五色梅对肝脏磷脂含量及超氧化物歧化酶活性无影响，而显着提高谷胱甘肽过氧化物酶活性。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-jve6ct7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-jve6ct7","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】毒性：乙醇提取物对大鼠毒性最大，由叶分离出来的马缨丹烯能降低对大鼠肝、肾切片的氧耗量。给乳牛或小牛犊按6g/kg剂量口服植物叶粉末可引起动物SGOT及血清胆红素含量升高，尸体解剖表明对肝脏有损害，胃、肠也有炎症。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-s4hch97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-s4hch97","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ob3jjlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ob3jjlv","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.净制：除去杂质，鲜品即可入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-cbgsico","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-cbgsico","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.切制：取净剂后的嫩枝，切段。也可将干品淋水稍润，切段，晒干，筛去灰屑，即可入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-qk63qm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-qk63qm4","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味苦；微甘；性凉；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-j17flmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-j17flmz","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-22a78n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-22a78n6","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热；止血。主肺痨咯血；腹痛吐泻；湿疹；阴痒"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-v1e1f4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-v1e1f4o","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-10g；研末，3-5g。外用：适量，捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-myjprwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-myjprwe","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】本品有毒，内服有头晕、恶心、呕吐等的反应，必须掌握用量，防止不良反应。孕妇及体弱者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ert5as1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ert5as1","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ebt4m30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ebt4m30","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《岭南采药录》：洗湿毒疥癞。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-kx03j3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-kx03j3c","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《南宁市药物志》：叶：治疥癞毒疮，跌打止血。花：可止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-ya5j2f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-ya5j2f7","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《广东中药》：祛风止痒，消肿止痛，散毒，敷大肠疡痈。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-9ii4bn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-9ii4bn7","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《广西中草药》：全草：退热，杀虫止痒，消疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115119-tsba9jc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115119-tsba9jc","updated":"20240830115135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115120-2ltz6q0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830115120-2ltz6q0","updated":"20240830115135"}},{"ID":"20240830115129-w8ggqej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115129-w8ggqej","updated":"20240830115135"}}]}